      en: ["Maganja da Costa was a key center of the Prazo land system in the 19th century.", "The region is one of the primary rice-producing areas in Zambezia Province.", "The nearby Licuári Forest is home to several rare and endemic bird species.", "The town is located about 150 kilometers northeast of the capital, Quelimane.", "The local population predominantly belongs to the Chuabo ethnic group.", "Traditional ceremonies are held annually to mark the beginning of the rice harvest."],
      es: ["Distrito en la provincia de Zambezia.", "Fuerte carácter agrícola.", "Importante espacio administrativo rural.", "Mercado regional para granjas.", "Parte del interior de Zambezia.", "Función de suministro para el entorno."],
      pt: ["Distrito na província da Zambézia.", "Forte carácter agrícola.", "Importante espaço administrativo rural.", "Mercado regional para explorações agrícolas.", "Parte do interior da Zambézia.", "Função de abastecimento para a região circundante."],
      fr: ["District dans la province de Zambézie.", "Forte empreinte agricole.", "Espace administratif rural important.", "Marché régional pour les exploitations agricoles.", "Fait partie de l'arrière-pays de la Zambézie.", "Fonction d'approvisionnement pour les environs."],
