      en: ["Namaacha sits at an elevation of approximately 500 to 600 meters above sea level.", "The Church of Our Lady of Fatima was officially inaugurated in 1944.", "The town is located about 75 kilometers west of the capital city, Maputo.", "The Namaacha Waterfall is a major natural attraction located just outside the town.", "The Goba-Namaacha border post is one of the busiest entry points from Eswatini.", "The area is famous for its bottled mineral water, which is distributed nationwide."],
