      en: ["Boane is the site of the Mozal aluminum smelter, a multi-billion dollar industrial project.", "The town is located approximately 30 kilometers southwest of Maputo city center.", "The Pequenos Libombos Dam on the Umbeluzi River is a major landmark in the district.", "Boane serves as a vital railway junction for the Goba and Ressano Garcia lines.", "The region is a leading producer of bananas, supplying both local and international markets.", "It is home to a major military training facility for the Mozambique Armed Forces."],
